From 9eb1587814048eb3ebecc80c5e2c1f7ada64aab3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Irina Shinakawa <25380803+chandr1000@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 15:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(bore): BORE scheduler for the GKI 6.6 family (5.9.6
 generation, wide-compat regen)

BORE (Burst-Oriented Response Enhancer) scheduler, firelzrd 5.9.6
generation, adapted to the Android GKI 6.6 tree. WIDE-COMPAT REGEN: this
form applies on every android15-6.6 pin from 6.6.46 through 6.6.144+ by
anchoring only on regions that are byte-stable across the family:

- kernel/fork.c: the bore.h include anchors on the
  asm/tlbflush.h -> trace/events/sched.h include run (present in every
  6.6 pin; the old anchor broke on pins without linux/tick.h and again
  when Google inserted linux/dma-buf.h on the 2025-08+ release
  branches). The dead CONFIG_USER_NS include of the vendored port is
  dropped: nothing in the BORE additions references user_namespace.
- include/linux/sched.h: task_struct group_burst moves from KABI slots
  1-2 to 3-4. Slots 1-2 are consumed upstream on the android15-6.6
  release branches from 2025-08 (dmabuf_info / user_dumpable
  ANDROID_KABI_USE blocks); slots 3/4/5 are free RESERVE lines on every
  6.6 pin, so one hunk serves both shapes. The genksyms view stays
  stock (same _ANDROID_KABI_REPLACE shield mechanics, same
  sched_burst_cache), so the CRC ledger is unchanged.
- kernel/sched/fair.c and scripts/setlocalversion are INTENTIONALLY NOT
  part of this core patch: both carry era-divergent stock text
  (base_slice 750000ULL vs 700000ULL; setlocalversion tab-shape rewrite)
  and are applied by scripts/bore_compat_apply.sh from
  patches/bore/compat/ micro-patches selected by tree probing.

Everything else is byte-identical to the boot-validated 2026-11-08
vendored form (shielded fair.c tripwire, features.h shield, bore.h,
bore.c, debug.c, core.c, Makefile, Kconfigs).

Provenance: firelzrd/bore-scheduler (5.9.6); WildKernels GKI port
(27cb8b3e, be224605, c606cc2a, eba7eac4, c2f54d01, 06488106); vendored
patch 0001-linux6.6.67-bore-5.9.6.patch @ main-chandr1000-bak (1e4570af);
wide-compat regen from the 6.6.46..6.6.144 pin matrix evidence.

Plan: BORE-6.6-family-compat-plan (2026-11-11); plan v3.0.0 section 4 (F1).
